ceived_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I really like the core idea, but I'm not sure why we're opting for a separate header/namespace over methods within `Span` itself. Everything so far uses `Span` as the first argument, and based off the name I imagine that'll be the case for the overwhelming majority of functions, so separating them feels like unnecessary bloat. Even if certain functions don't need to be scoped under `Span`, the convention is generally to have accompanying classes/functions within the same file (`Variant` being the only real exception thanks to its insane size), so that code should all be in `span.h` regardless.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103932#pullrequestreview-2688004332","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103932","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103932#pullrequestreview-2688004332"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103932"}},"submitted_at":"2025-03-15T16:33:46Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2688155185,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6gOf4x","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"h